<ul>
<li>14 CFR Part 101, Subpart A (§§ 101.1–101.7) and Subpart D (§§ 101.31–101.39), <a href="https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-14/chapter-I/subchapter-F/part-101">Electronic Code of Federal Regulations</a>, current as of November 19, 2026. Citations to the Federal Register amendments are listed with each section on the eCFR.</li>
